\end{align*}We can now compare the two expressions.  We want to find the smallest $k$ such that \begin{align*}
\frac{(10^9)!}{k!(10^9-k)!} < \frac{(10^9 + 1)!}{(k - 1)!(10^9 - k + 2)!}.
\end{align*}We can rewrite this as \begin{align*}
